121Extract your internal Google Cloud project parameters dynamically, construct the Artifact Registry repository, 
configure Docker's secure handshake, and dispatch the asset.

Code:
//Change the parameters accordingly.
# Create the repository in us-central1
gcloud artifacts repositories create valkyrie-repository \
    --repository-format=docker \
    --location=us-central1                                            

# Authenticate Docker for us-central1
gcloud auth configure-docker us-central1-docker.pkg.dev

# Tag the image with your exact project details
docker tag valkyrie-prod:v0.0.3 us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/qwiklabs-gcp-01-5ab2283a3c9e/valkyrie-repository/valkyrie-prod:v0.0.3

# Push image to your registry
docker push us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/qwiklabs-gcp-01-5ab2283a3c9e/valkyrie-repository/valkyrie-prod:v0.0.3



